  Number of protons per bunch & $1.15\times 10^{11}$\\
  beta function at the collision point($\beta^{\ast}$)& 0.55~m \\
  Transverse RMS beam size at impact point($\sigma^{\ast}$) & 16.3~$\mu$m  \\
  Dipole field at 7~TeV(B) & 8.33~T \\
  Dipole temperature (T)   & 1.9~K \\ \hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
\end{table}
